# Illustrative example -- see SELF_HOSTING.md. Copy to `Caddyfile`, replace
# your-domain.com, and adjust as needed. Caddy issues and renews the
# certificate automatically via Let's Encrypt (or ZeroSSL as fallback) --
# nothing else to configure for standard domains.
#
# For .ru/.su domains, Let's Encrypt has restricted issuance/renewal as of
# mid-2026 -- see SELF_HOSTING.md's ".ru / .su domains" section for the
# current alternative path (the Russian national CA via Gosuslugi) and
# Caddy's docs for configuring a custom/manual ACME CA or an externally
# issued certificate instead of the automatic default.

your-domain.com {
    reverse_proxy web:80
}
